      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلوّث</span></b>  <i>It</i> (a garment) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, befouled, defiled, polluted, dirtied, soiled, besmeared,</i>
or <i>bedaubed,</i> with mud. (Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تلوّث بِالْأَمْرِ</span>
[app., <i>He was confused,</i> or <i>perplexed, by the
affair</i>]. (Lth.)

